#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.rst:196
msgid ""
":ref:`TileMapLayer.get_coords_for_body_rid() "
"<class_TileMapLayer_method_get_coords_for_body_rid>` will return different "
"values in 4.5 compared to 4.4, as TileMapLayer physics chunking is enabled "
"by default. Higher values of :ref:`TileMapLayer.physics_quadrant_size "
"<class_TileMapLayer_property_physics_quadrant_size>` will make this function "
"less precise. To get the exact cell coordinates like in 4.4 and prior "
"versions, you need to set :ref:`TileMapLayer.physics_quadrant_size "
"<class_TileMapLayer_property_physics_quadrant_size>` to ``1``, which "
"disables physics chunking."
